<!--
  Status-bar icon for the playback notification.

  Deliberately a flat white silhouette rather than the launcher icon: Android
  masks a status-bar icon to its alpha channel, so anything with colour or a
  background comes out as a white blob. This is the play triangle from
  icon.svg alone, which survives that treatment.
-->
